      "title": "Hotel authorization holds",
      "effective_at": "2026-07-01",
      "content": "Hotels commonly authorize an amount for incidentals on top of the room charges, so a hotel hold can exceed the room total. An authorization is approved only when the card's available credit covers the full authorized amount. No authorization is guaranteed to be approved. A hotel hold may remain pending for a few days after checkout, depending on when the merchant finalizes the charge."
